jsonl / reducer / durable log
discord login + wholesale role import
ai clerk (notes only)

constitution (split from this file):
  src/lib.rs          stance
  src/ids.rs          linkable identifiers
  src/links.rs        stable paths for every entity
  src/types.rs        seats, hearing, phases, kinds, rules
  src/events.rs       the only way anything happens
  src/state.rs        principals, cases, policies, attempt journal
  src/scoring.rs      weighted plurality (no pairwise)
  src/config.rs       discord role id → seat + weight
  src/reducer.rs      the constitution

franchise is a standing bench from discord roles, snapshotted
when deliberation opens. hearing is opt-in. a cheat case is a
record, not a trial. verdicts are frozen snapshots.

env (judge):
  JUDGE_BIND JUDGE_PUBLIC_URL JUDGE_DATA_DIR JUDGE_CONFIG JUDGE_SESSION_SECRET
  DISCORD_CLIENT_ID DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET DISCORD_REDIRECT_URI DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
  DISCORD_API_BASE          default https://discord.com/api/v10
  DISCORD_AUTHORIZE_URL     default https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize

env (tests / mock-discord binary):
  point DISCORD_API_BASE and DISCORD_AUTHORIZE_URL at the mock
  MOCK_DISCORD_USERS_JSON MOCK_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID MOCK_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
  MOCK_DISCORD_GUILD_ID
